  "description": "SixLabors.ImageSharp format plugin for Apple QuickDraw PICT pictures, QuickTime image files (QTIF) and MacPaint documents: detection, Macintosh-exact decoding with QuickDraw.Pict (JPEG/PNG/GIF/TIFF/WebP/BMP QuickTime images through ImageSharp, outline-font text through SixLabors.Fonts when no bitmap font is supplied) and PICT encoding (indexed, 16-bit, 32-bit with alpha, resolution, ICC).",
